1
00:00:56,170 --> 00:00:58,730
[Eclipse in the Lost City] [Episode 20]

2
00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:00,870
[7]

3
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:09,539
Another cup, please.

4
00:01:09,539 --> 00:01:10,340
Okay.

5
00:01:25,230 --> 00:01:26,030
Enjoy.

6
00:01:36,060 --> 00:01:36,860
Here you go.

7
00:01:54,460 --> 00:01:55,860
Have they figured me out?

8
00:01:56,860 --> 00:02:00,460
It seems there's no point
in waiting any longer.

9
00:02:07,900 --> 00:02:08,780
Sir.

10
00:02:09,539 --> 00:02:10,780
Who exactly are you?

11
00:02:23,460 --> 00:02:25,760
[Spirit Tablet of Lu Wenbiao]

12
00:02:36,380 --> 00:02:39,660
Are you ready to restore the Qingtian Gang
to its former glory?

13
00:02:39,660 --> 00:02:41,740
I'd be happy to lend you a hand.

14
00:02:41,910 --> 00:02:43,570
The docks, casinos, and opium dens...

15
00:02:43,570 --> 00:02:45,570
These all belong to the Shisha Gang.

16
00:02:46,380 --> 00:02:47,180
Young Master.

17
00:02:47,350 --> 00:02:50,820
Does he mean to abandon Xu Qingdao
and support you instead?

18
00:02:54,110 --> 00:02:56,560
He may not want to support anyone
in particular,

19
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:58,890
but he definitely wants
to bring someone down.

20
00:02:58,890 --> 00:02:59,910
If the Qingtian Gang rises,

21
00:02:59,910 --> 00:03:01,710
the Shisha Gang will be unhappy.

22
00:03:02,910 --> 00:03:04,960
As long as it means
keeping Xu Qingdao in check,

23
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:07,080
he's willing to extend
an olive branch to me.

24
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:09,960
Right now, the Qingtian Gang is valuable,

25
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:11,880
so for now, everything is negotiable.

26
00:03:11,880 --> 00:03:14,480
But once the Qingtian Gang
is no longer useful,

27
00:03:14,920 --> 00:03:17,320
he'll discard us without a second thought.

28
00:03:17,660 --> 00:03:19,340
Then should we turn him down?

29
00:03:19,880 --> 00:03:20,680
Turn him down?

30
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:23,040
Why would we turn down

31
00:03:23,970 --> 00:03:25,370
such a good opportunity?

32
00:03:26,160 --> 00:03:27,020
Right,

33
00:03:27,440 --> 00:03:28,160
old man?

34
00:03:31,560 --> 00:03:34,040
Qingtian Gang Casino
Grand Opening Promotion!

35
00:03:34,040 --> 00:03:35,720
Come and take a look!

36
00:03:36,160 --> 00:03:37,400
This is strange.

37
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:40,160
Isn't this Shisha Gang territory?

38
00:03:40,160 --> 00:03:41,000
I heard

39
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:44,079
only Xu Qingdao
got the license for this street.

40
00:03:44,340 --> 00:03:46,520
So how is Lu Ye running a casino here too?

41
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:47,840
You couldn't even figure that out?

42
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:50,450
The Qingtian Gang found themselves
a powerful backer.

43
00:03:50,450 --> 00:03:52,110
Take a look!

44
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:54,430
Take a look!

45
00:03:54,450 --> 00:03:56,450
Go away!

46
00:03:56,770 --> 00:03:57,270
Get lost!

47
00:03:57,270 --> 00:03:57,829
Move!

48
00:03:58,040 --> 00:03:59,300
Who told you to be here?

49
00:03:59,410 --> 00:04:00,490
Hurry up, get lost!

50
00:04:02,960 --> 00:04:04,040
Get lost! I'm talking to you!

51
00:04:04,040 --> 00:04:04,520
I'm talking to you!

52
00:04:04,520 --> 00:04:05,120
Get lost!

53
00:04:05,310 --> 00:04:06,830
Look who it is.

54
00:04:07,440 --> 00:04:09,840
Officer Shen, want to play a round?

55
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:10,640
Lu Ye.

56
00:04:10,840 --> 00:04:13,240
Only the Shisha Gang
can open a casino here.

57
00:04:13,680 --> 00:04:15,560
Didn't your father tell you
before he died?

58
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:18,040
Times have changed.

59
00:04:19,839 --> 00:04:22,000
See the business license?

60
00:04:22,360 --> 00:04:25,090
The Qingtian Gang has always played
by the rules.

61
00:04:25,920 --> 00:04:28,250
The only rules here are the Shisha Gang's.

62
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:30,240
Beat them up!

63
00:04:30,240 --> 00:04:30,920
What are you waiting for?

64
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:31,920
Get them!

65
00:04:33,400 --> 00:04:34,000
Come on!

66
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:53,210
The casinos on East Street,

67
00:04:53,280 --> 00:04:54,760
the docks at Sanjiao Crossing,

68
00:04:54,760 --> 00:04:56,690
and the opium dens in South Market.

69
00:04:56,960 --> 00:04:58,360
All I have to do is give the word,

70
00:04:58,360 --> 00:05:01,000
and all of this will belong
to the Qingtian Gang.

71
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:01,920
How about it?

72
00:05:02,030 --> 00:05:02,890
Are you scared?

73
00:05:06,320 --> 00:05:09,120
Sir is certainly generous.

74
00:05:10,520 --> 00:05:12,840
He knows Xu Qingdao very well.

75
00:05:13,320 --> 00:05:15,920
These are all his most important places.

76
00:05:17,580 --> 00:05:19,180
That proves our plan worked.

77
00:05:19,580 --> 00:05:22,520
Xu Qingdao ran for vice president of
the Chamber of Commerce behind his back,

78
00:05:22,520 --> 00:05:23,900
then killed the director,

79
00:05:23,900 --> 00:05:25,340
and won't even meet him.

80
00:05:26,420 --> 00:05:28,120
He must be thinking
of turning against him.

81
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:31,180
That's why he's eager
to reach out to the Qingtian Gang.

82
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:33,070
Xu Qingdao has also been dissatisfied
for a long time.

83
00:05:33,070 --> 00:05:34,000
He's ambitious.

84
00:05:34,040 --> 00:05:35,760
He doesn't want to answer to anyone.

85
00:05:35,760 --> 00:05:36,960
After what happened today,

86
00:05:36,960 --> 00:05:38,659
all of Ningcheng knows about it.

87
00:05:38,659 --> 00:05:40,320
It will definitely reach their ears.

88
00:05:40,320 --> 00:05:42,600
One thinks he has won over
the Qingtian Gang,

89
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:45,130
while the other thinks
he has been abandoned.

90
00:05:46,280 --> 00:05:47,080
Perfect.

91
00:05:49,960 --> 00:05:51,020
It's time to leave.

92
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:52,400
Wait a minute.

93
00:06:08,670 --> 00:06:10,870
Now we look like we just got into a fight.

94
00:06:11,200 --> 00:06:12,000
Let's go.

95
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:19,520
What's wrong?

96
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:24,960
Nothing.

97
00:06:25,890 --> 00:06:26,690
Then let's go.

98
00:06:28,170 --> 00:06:28,850
Hurry.

99
00:06:31,440 --> 00:06:33,120
Chief, I've confirmed it.

100
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:36,800
Lu Ye really does have a license
from the Industrial and Commercial Bureau.

101
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:38,320
I don't know where he got it.

102
00:06:38,320 --> 00:06:39,110
What?

103
00:06:41,200 --> 00:06:42,640
Chief, bad news.

104
00:06:42,840 --> 00:06:44,159
Our goods have been seized.

105
00:06:44,159 --> 00:06:46,400
The casinos in the south have been sealed.

106
00:06:46,400 --> 00:06:47,040
And...

107
00:06:47,159 --> 00:06:47,920
And...

108
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:48,650
Talk!

109
00:06:48,840 --> 00:06:51,100
And they've taken over those docks, too.

110
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:53,640
This is going too far.

111
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:55,510
Chief.

112
00:06:55,700 --> 00:06:56,700
In my opinion,

113
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:59,280
this is probably that person's doing.

114
00:07:00,640 --> 00:07:01,570
What do you mean?

115
00:07:01,800 --> 00:07:02,720
Think about it.

116
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:05,040
Besides that person,

117
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:08,820
who else has that kind of power
in Ningcheng?

118
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:13,840
It seems he wants to kick me out

119
00:07:14,320 --> 00:07:15,720
and put Lu Ye in my place.

120
00:07:16,400 --> 00:07:18,080
If you don't make your move soon,

121
00:07:18,080 --> 00:07:20,210
you'll have to wait for him to make his.

122
00:07:30,560 --> 00:07:32,760
Xu Qingdao, oh, Xu Qingdao.

123
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:34,650
You've really grown some guts,

124
00:07:34,880 --> 00:07:36,720
threatening me like this.

125
00:07:37,400 --> 00:07:39,800
You've certainly kept track of every favor

126
00:07:39,920 --> 00:07:43,050
and every debt
involving the Shisha Gang over the years.

127
00:07:54,960 --> 00:07:55,760
Sir.

128
00:07:56,370 --> 00:07:57,480
What are your orders?

129
00:07:57,480 --> 00:08:00,560
Xu Qingdao's birthday
is in a few days, right?

130
00:08:00,840 --> 00:08:02,960
Book a table for me at Dashijie.

131
00:08:03,200 --> 00:08:05,880
Tell him I've prepared a birthday dinner

132
00:08:05,880 --> 00:08:07,120
and that he must come.

133
00:08:07,520 --> 00:08:09,850
I've prepared a little something for him.

134
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:22,330
What are you looking at?

135
00:08:23,700 --> 00:08:25,120
I sent someone to investigate.

136
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:27,900
The director of Renji Hospital
studied medicine abroad.

137
00:08:27,900 --> 00:08:29,370
I've gathered all the papers

138
00:08:29,370 --> 00:08:30,680
and research materials he's published.

139
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:31,880
There might be clues.

140
00:08:33,919 --> 00:08:34,600
By the way.

141
00:08:34,880 --> 00:08:36,520
Xu Qingdao's birthday is in two days.

142
00:08:36,520 --> 00:08:38,720
Sir said he will host a banquet for him.

143
00:08:41,799 --> 00:08:43,039
Then this is a trap.

144
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:44,520
Will he go?

145
00:08:46,220 --> 00:08:47,110
With me there,

146
00:08:47,290 --> 00:08:48,890
does he really have a choice?

147
00:08:50,050 --> 00:08:51,380
Xu Qingdao will be gone.

148
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:52,930
That's perfect.

149
00:08:53,360 --> 00:08:53,960
I...

150
00:09:00,800 --> 00:09:03,930
can sneak into the Shisha Gang
to find the antidote then.

151
00:09:04,760 --> 00:09:07,470
Blood...

152
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:08,840
Get stronger.

153
00:09:09,840 --> 00:09:10,760
Shen Tianbai.

154
00:09:11,350 --> 00:09:12,080
Shen Tianbai.

155
00:09:12,080 --> 00:09:12,880
Get stronger.

156
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:14,280
Get stronger.

157
00:09:15,120 --> 00:09:15,560
Blood.

158
00:09:15,560 --> 00:09:16,360
What's wrong?

159
00:09:16,480 --> 00:09:17,280
Get stronger.

160
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:19,130
Turn into a wolf.

161
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:21,720
Protect the weak.

162
00:09:24,560 --> 00:09:25,490
Turn into a wolf.

163
00:09:25,710 --> 00:09:26,360
Don't listen.

164
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:27,160
Turn into a wolf.

165
00:09:27,160 --> 00:09:28,490
Don't listen to anyone.

166
00:09:29,680 --> 00:09:30,680
Just listen to me.

167
00:09:31,510 --> 00:09:32,310
Get stronger.

168
00:09:32,800 --> 00:09:33,720
Become a wolf.

169
00:09:35,840 --> 00:09:37,370
Your heartbeat is too fast.

170
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:38,800
This won't do.

171
00:09:42,160 --> 00:09:43,400
Feel my heartbeat.

172
00:09:48,360 --> 00:09:49,010
1.

173
00:09:50,480 --> 00:09:51,170
2.

174
00:09:53,140 --> 00:09:53,720
3.

175
00:09:56,240 --> 00:10:01,140
♪ The lights go out, the door is closed ♪

176
00:10:01,270 --> 00:10:02,630
Feel

177
00:10:02,960 --> 00:10:08,510
♪ I'm waiting for someone
through the night ♪

178
00:10:03,040 --> 00:10:04,280
my heartbeat.

179
00:10:04,310 --> 00:10:05,050
1.

180
00:10:05,750 --> 00:10:06,500
2.

181
00:10:09,160 --> 00:10:09,680
3.

182
00:10:09,810 --> 00:10:14,720
♪ Just like the look in your eyes
when you left that year ♪

183
00:10:12,480 --> 00:10:13,410
Feeling better?

184
00:10:16,400 --> 00:10:21,950
♪ Your eyes said you'd come home
with the spring breeze ♪

185
00:10:23,270 --> 00:10:28,210
♪ On the old platform,
the wind keeps asking why ♪

186
00:10:24,020 --> 00:10:24,810
1.

187
00:10:25,920 --> 00:10:26,840
2.

188
00:10:29,340 --> 00:10:35,480
♪ Half a lifetime of partings
goes unspoken ♪

189
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:42,330
♪ I still believe you'll open that door ♪

190
00:10:42,540 --> 00:10:46,190
♪ From wind-swept mornings ♪

191
00:10:46,210 --> 00:10:49,750
♪ To the heavy setting sun ♪

192
00:10:49,810 --> 00:10:56,080
♪ You promised you'd come back
and recognize me ♪

193
00:10:56,680 --> 00:10:57,480
You're awake.

194
00:10:58,360 --> 00:10:59,480
Did you find it?

195
00:11:00,820 --> 00:11:03,580
The director conducted similar experiments
while he was studying abroad,

196
00:11:03,580 --> 00:11:05,380
but they used animals back then.

197
00:11:05,450 --> 00:11:06,890
I could only make out the basics.

198
00:11:06,890 --> 00:11:09,950
As for the rest,
I'll ask some contacts I have overseas.

199
00:11:10,050 --> 00:11:10,520
Okay.

200
00:11:11,720 --> 00:11:13,320
Have you been feeling unwell

201
00:11:13,400 --> 00:11:15,260
ever since you left the hospital?

202
00:11:16,480 --> 00:11:17,240
I...

203
00:11:17,380 --> 00:11:18,380
Tell me the truth.

204
00:11:22,520 --> 00:11:23,780
Why didn't you tell me?

205
00:11:30,320 --> 00:11:32,480
You have enough to worry about.

206
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:37,920
Could I possibly have more to worry about
than you, Officer Shen?

207
00:11:38,040 --> 00:11:39,680
You and Xu Qingdao go to the banquet.

208
00:11:39,680 --> 00:11:41,600
I'll go to the Shisha Gang
to get the antidote.

209
00:11:41,600 --> 00:11:44,400
I will definitely find the antidote.

210
00:11:46,400 --> 00:11:47,200
Okay.
